/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 104 0 R
/T (The function structure, justified prototypes, both multi-value designs and the pointer operations were completed and verified by a running program. I learned when to use const, why pointers are used for output parameters, and why a pointer to a local variable must never be returned.)
/E (The function structure, justified prototypes, both multi-value designs and the pointer operations were completed and verified by a running program. I learned when to use const, why pointers are used for output parameters, and why a pointer to a local variable must never be returned.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [2]
>>
