/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 115 0 R
/T (The in-place update worked \(record 3 done, record 9 failed without damage\) and both formats read back identical data. Binary was about 1,000 times faster for updating one record, so binary is recommended for stock and text for donors.)
/E (The in-place update worked \(record 3 done, record 9 failed without damage\) and both formats read back identical data. Binary was about 1,000 times faster for updating one record, so binary is recommended for stock and text for donors.)
