<<
/Title (Case study: A district has one central blood bank and several hospital storage units. Donor records hold ID, name, blood group, age, phone and date of last donation; stock records hold a blood group and units available. The program must register donors, find eligible donors of a group, update stock after every donation and issue, and keep all data in files. Assumption used throughout: a donor is eligible if age is 18 to 65 and at least 90 days have passed since the last donation. Task map: Task 1 = A1, A3 | Task 2 = A2, B1 | Task 3 = A4, B4 | Task 4 = A5, B3 | Task 5 = B2.)
