/Title (Why updating record 9 fails and the file is not damaged: the file holds only records 0 to 4. fseek beyond the end is allowed, but fread then returns 0, so update_units returns 0 before any fwrite is made. Nothing is written, so the file stays exactly as it was \(output 1:40 2:25 3:12 4:20 5:30, only record 3 changed\).)
