/Title (malloc, realloc and free manage heap memory. realloc may move a block, so the old pointer must not be used afterwards and its result must be checked before replacing the old pointer. Doubling the capacity gives amortised O\(1\) appends because the total copying is O\(n\).)
/Dest [18 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 2105 0 R
/Next 2116 0 R
>>
endobj
2116 0 obj
<<
